@startuml F3.4-D02-deferir-solicitacao
title F3.4-D02 — Deferir solicitação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
participant "DeliberateRequestUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Deferir com parecer
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests/{id}/transitions\n{ action: DEFER }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  request.deliberate x Transition
  guard workflow; JTI se deep-link
end note
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE estado\n+ request_event\n+ audit_log\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: redireciona à fila

@enduml
